{"ticker":"APTV","updated":"2026-10-30T22:34:48Z","profile":{"longName":"Aptiv PLC","shortName":"Aptiv PLC","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Switzerland","website":"https://www.aptiv.com","fullTimeEmployees":140000,"marketCap":9121332224,"trailingPE":43.49505,"forwardPE":6.786495,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.4445527,"pegRatio":0.95,"targetMeanPrice":64.33333,"targetHighPrice":77.0,"targetLowPrice":50.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.023,"earningsGrowth":-0.353,"grossMargins":0.19251,"operatingMargins":0.12675999,"profitMargins":0.010720001,"totalRevenue":20518000640,"beta":1.365,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":88.93,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":41.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Aptiv PLC, an industrial technology company, provides hardware and software solutions to support automotive and other industries in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and South America. It operates through three segments: Advanced Safety and User Experience, Engineered Components, and Electrical Distribution Systems. The company offers active safety, user experience and smart vehicle compute, and software products for vehicle safety and security, including intelligent sensors, compute platforms, and software tools and services. It also provides connection systems, interconnects, and cable management and protection solutions for the distribution of power, signal, and data. Aptiv PLC was incorporated in 2011 and is based in Schaffhausen, Switzerland.","summary_zh":"Aptiv PLC 是一家工業技術公司，提供硬體和軟體解決方案來支援北美、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太地區和南美的汽車和其他產業。它透過三個部分運作：高級安全和用戶體驗、工程組件和配電系統。該公司提供主動安全、用戶體驗和智慧車輛運算以及用於車輛安全和保障的軟體產品，包括智慧感測器、運算平台以及軟體工具和服務。它還為電力、訊號和數據的分配提供連接系統、互連以及電纜管理和保護解決方案。 Aptiv PLC 成立於 2011 年，總部位於瑞士沙夫豪森。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":78.12,"h":78.89,"l":77.5,"c":78.39,"v":3164300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":78.86,"h":80.46,"l":78.8,"c"