zation transaction (the \"Transaction,\" or the \"reorganization transaction\"), in which Old Aptiv established a new publicly-listed Jersey parent company, Aptiv Holdings Limited (\"New Aptiv\"), which is resident for tax purposes in Switzerland. As a result of the Transaction, all issued and outstanding ordinary shares of Old Aptiv were exchanged on a one-for-one basis for newly issued ordinary shares of New Aptiv. Following consummation of the Transaction, holders of Old Aptiv shares became ordinary shareholders of New Aptiv, Old Aptiv became a wholly-owned subsidiary of New Aptiv and New Aptiv was renamed \"Aptiv PLC.\" The previous publicly-listed Jersey parent company, which was an Irish tax resident, is referred to as \"Old Apt","zh":"2024年12月，於2011年5月19日根據澤西島法律成立的上市有限公司Old Aptiv（定義見下文）完成了先前宣布的重組交易（「交易」或「重組交易」），其中Old Aptiv成立了一家新的上市澤西母公司Aptiv Holdings Limited（「New Aptiv」），該公司是瑞士的稅務居民。交易完成後，舊安波福的所有已發行和流通普通股均以一對一的方式交換為新安波福新發行的普通股。交易完成後，舊安波福股份持有人成為新安波福的普通股東，舊安波福成為新安波福的全資子公司，新安波福更名為「Aptiv PLC」。先前公開上市的澤西島母公司是愛爾蘭稅務居民，被稱為“Old Apt”"},{"en":"In December 2024, following the completion of the Transaction, Old Aptiv merged with and into Aptiv Swiss Holdings Limited (\"Aptiv Swiss Holdings\"), a newly formed Jersey incorporated private limited company, and a direct, wholly-owned subsidiary of New Aptiv, with Aptiv Swiss Holdings surviving as a direct, wholly owned subsidiary of New Aptiv, and Old Aptiv ceasing to exist. Except as otherwise noted, all property, rights, privileges, powers and franchises of Old Aptiv vested in Aptiv Swiss Holdings, and all debts, liabilities and duties of Old Aptiv became debts, liabilities and duties of Aptiv Swiss Holdings.","zh":"2024年12月，交易完成後，老安波福合併入安波福瑞士控股有限公司（「安波福瑞士控股」），這是一家新成立的澤西註冊私人有限公司，也是新安波福的直接全資子公司，安波福瑞士控股作為新安波福的直接全資子公司存續，老安波福不再存在。除非另有說明，老安波福的所有財產、權利、特權、權力和特許經營權均歸屬安波福瑞士控股公司，老安波福的所有債務、負債和義務均成為安波福瑞士控股公司的債務、負債和義務。"},{"en":"In connection with the Transaction, New Aptiv assumed Old Aptiv's long-term incentive plans and its existing obligations in connection with awards granted thereunder, and Aptiv Swiss Holdings (i) entered into a supplemental indenture to each indenture in which Aptiv Swiss Holdings assumed all of Old Aptiv's obligations under each series of Old Aptiv's outstanding Notes and (ii) entered into an assumption and/or supplement agreement relating to the Credit Agreement in which New Aptiv assumed all of Old Aptiv's obligations under the Credit Agreement as the \"parent entity\" thereunder. In addition, New Aptiv (i) entered into a supplemental indenture to each indenture in which New Aptiv guaranteed the outstanding Notes and (ii) entered into a guarantee joinder relating to the Credit Agreement in which New Aptiv guaranteed the obligations under the Credit Agreement. Following the reorganizatio","zh":"就本次交易而言，新安波福承擔了老安波福的長期激勵計劃及其與根據該計劃授予的獎勵有關的現有義務，並且安波福瑞士控股公司(i)與每份契約簽訂了一份補充契約，其中安波福瑞士控股公司承擔了舊安波福在各系列已發行票據下的所有義務，以及(ii)簽訂了一項與信貸協議相關的承擔和/或補充協議，其中新安波福承擔了老安波福在信貸協議下的所有義務，作為其下的“母實體”。此外，新安波福 (i) 與每份契約簽訂了一份補充契約，其中新安波福為未償還票據提供擔保；(ii) 簽訂了與信貸協議相關的擔保聯合協議，其中新安波福為信貸協議項下的義務提供擔保。重組後"}],"markets":[{"en":"Advanced Safety and User Experience. This segment provides critical technologies and services to enhance vehicle safety, security, comfort and convenience, including intelligent sensors, high-performance compute, advanced software for applications such as Advanced Driver Assistance Systems and User Experience, as well as tools and services.","zh":"先進的安全性和使用者體驗。該部門提供關鍵技術和服務，以提高車輛的安全性、舒適性和便利性，包括智慧感測器、高效能運算、高級駕駛輔助系統和使用者體驗等應用的高級軟體以及工具和服務。"},{"en":"Advanced Safety includes solutions that enable advanced safety features and vehicle automation, as well as radar, vision and other sensing technologies.","zh":"進階安全性包括可實現高級安全功能和車輛自動化的解決方案，以及雷達、視覺和其他感測技術。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We sell our products and services to the major global OEMs in every region of the world. Our ten largest customers accounted for approximately 56% of our total net sales for the year ended December 31, 2025, which included approximately 10% to an individual Global OEM.","zh":"我們向世界各地區的主要全球原始設備製造商銷售我們的產品和服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，我們的十大客戶約占我們總淨銷售額的 56%，其中約 10% 為單一全球 OEM。"},{"en":"We typically supply products to our OEM customers through purchase orders, which are generally governed by general terms and conditions established by each OEM. Although the terms and conditions vary from customer to customer, they typically contemplate a relationship under which our customers place orders for their requirements of specific components supplied for particular vehicles but are not required to purchase any minimum amount of products from us. These relationships typically extend over the life of the related vehicle. Prices are negotiated with respect to each business award, which may be subject to adjustments under certain circumstances, such as commodity or foreign exchange escalation/de-escalation clauses, significant changes in direct labor costs, for specification/design changes during the life of the program or for cost reductions achieved by us. The terms and condition","zh":"我們通常透過採購訂單向 OEM 客戶供應產品，採購訂單通常受每個 OEM 制定的一般條款和條件的約束。儘管條款和條件因客戶而異，但他們通常考慮建立一種關係，在該關係下，我們的客戶根據其對為特定車輛供應的特定組件的要求下訂單，但不要求從我們購買任何最低數量的產品。這些關係通常會延續到相關車輛的整個使用壽命。價格是根據每項業務獎勵進行協商的，在某些情況下可能會進行調整，例如商品或外匯升級/降級條款、直接勞動力成本的重大變化、項目生命週期內規格/設計的變化或我​​們實現的成本降低。條款與條件"}],"competition":[{"en":"The automotive technology and components industry remains extremely competitive. Furthermore, the rapidly evolving nature of the markets in which we compete has attracted, and may continue to attract, new entrants, particularly in best cost countries such as China and in areas of evolving vehicle technologies such as intelligent systems software, automated driving and mobility solutions, which has attracted competitors from outside the traditional automotive industry. OEMs rigorously evaluate suppliers on the basis of product quality, price, reliability and timeliness of delivery, product design capability, technical expertise and development capability, new product innovation, financial viability, application of lean principles, operational flexibility, customer service and overall management. In addition, our customers generally require that we demonstrate improved efficiencies, throug","zh":"汽車技術和零件行業仍然競爭激烈。此外，我們競爭的市場的快速發展性質已經吸引並可能繼續吸引新進入者，特別是在中國等最佳成本國家以及智慧系統軟體、自動駕駛和行動解決方案等不斷發展的汽車技術領域，這些領域吸引了來自傳統汽車行業之外的競爭對手。原始設備製造商根據產品品質、價格、交付的可靠性和及時性、產品設計能力、技術專長和開發能力、新產品創新、財務可行性、精益原則的應用、營運靈活性、客戶服務和整體管理來嚴格評估供應商。此外，我們的客戶通常會要求我們透過以下方式展示提高的效率："},{"en":"We sell our products and services to the major global OEMs in every region of the world. Our ten largest customers accounted for approximately 56% of our total net sales for the year ended December 31, 2025, which included approximately 10% to an individual Global OEM.","zh":"我們向世界各地區的主要全球原始設備製造商銷售我們的產品和服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度，我們的十大客戶約占我們總淨銷售額的 56%，其中約 10% 為單一全球 OEM。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electrical Distribution Systems","val":8818000000,"zh":"配電系統"},{"name":"Engineered Components Group","val":6662000000,"zh":"工程部件組"},{"name":"Advanced Safetyand User Experience","val":5792000000,"zh":"先進的安全性和使用者體驗"}],"total":20398000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":7568000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":7361000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":6566000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":5872000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"DE","val":1639000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"South America","val":392000000,"zh":"南美洲"},{"name":"Other North America","val":207000000,"zh":"北美其他地區"}],"total":20398000000}},"peers":["BWA","FTV","IQV","LKQ","ALLE"]}}